  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {即死|そくし}する (die instantly)\n- {即死|そくし}だった (was dead on the spot)\n- {即死|そくし}{攻撃|こうげき} (one-hit kill attack — gaming)\n\nUSAGE:\nFrequently appears in news reports about traffic accidents and disasters. In gaming contexts, {即死|そくし} refers to attacks or traps that kill a character in one hit regardless of remaining health. The noun form is often used as a predicate with だった: {即死|そくし}だった (was an instant death / died on the spot).",
